4.4 Value Addition
To improve profitability, the project identified several value addition opportunities.
These included:
•	Hygienic slaughter and dressing of birds.
•	Attractive packaging.
•	Branding of poultry products.
•	Sale of cleaned whole chicken.
•	Sale of poultry manure to crop farmers.
•	Processing chicken into assorted cuts for consumers.
Value addition increases product quality, customer satisfaction, and selling price while expanding market opportunities.
